  "resume": "The document is a parliamentary record of the Swiss Council of States (Ständerat) session on 22 September 2015, concerning the first package of measures for the energy strategy 2050 and the nuclear phase-out initiative. It lists the speakers who participated in the debate and is part of the video recordings of the Council of States proceedings for the winter session 2011 to autumn session 2015."
